The following files in this repository are derivative works based on
PhysicsNeMo source code, with modifications:

  - conf/*.yaml                              (training/generation configs)
  - swaither/datasets/base.py                (unmodified; provides DownscalingDataset)
  - swaither/datasets/dataset.py             (modified: removed cwb/hrrr_mini/gefs_hrrr
                                              dataset registrations not used here)
  - swaither/datasets/downscaling_dataset.py (derived from physicsnemo example
                                              datasets, substantially modified)
  - scripts/train_weekly.py                  (derived from physicsnemo CorrDiff
                                              training script, substantially modified
                                              for lead-time-aware bias correction with
                                              a rolling weekly train/test split)
  - scripts/train_yearly.py                  (same as above, but with a year-based
                                              train/test split)
  - scripts/generate_super_resolution.py     (derived from physicsnemo CorrDiff
                                              generation script, modified for
                                              multi-lead inference)

Modifications are described in:

  - The paper accompanying this code:
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16163

  - File-level copyright headers (when applicable).

All other code in this repository is original work by the SwAIther-Precip
authors, also licensed under Apache 2.0.

This product additionally uses the following datasets, which are NOT
redistributed with the code:

  - AIFS forecasts:   produced by ECMWF (European Centre for Medium-Range
                      Weather Forecasts). See https://www.ecmwf.int/en/forecasts/datasets/aifs
  - CombiPrecip:      produced by MeteoSwiss (Federal Office of Meteorology
                      and Climatology). Licensed for non-commercial research.
